```console
$ scherzo-cloud runner --help
Manage the Scherzo Cloud runner

Usage: scherzo-cloud runner [COMMAND]

Commands:
  activation  Manage runner enrollment activations
  create      Create a runner registration and enrollment activation
  credential  Manage runner credential lifecycle
  delete      Delete a runner registration
  disable     Disable a runner registration
  doctor      Check local runner prerequisites
  drain       Drain a runner registration
  enable      Enable a runner registration
  enroll      Enroll a runner credential
  list        List runner registrations
  move        Move a runner registration
  pool        Manage Scherzo Cloud runner pools
  rename      Rename a runner registration
  serve       Serve run assignments
  show        Show a runner registration
  status      Show live Runner Serve status
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
